<section class="gg-ad-landing">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-ad-hero">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support Goal Grower</span>
      <h1>Shop to help Goal Grower grow.</h1>
      <p>
        Every purchase helps fund the work behind the app: development, testing, and the launch
        experience. Your support makes the product stronger and brings the goal garden closer to life.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Shop to Support</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn-soft">See Support Impact</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-purchase-grid">
      <div class="gg-purchase-card">
        <span>🛍️</span>
        <h2>Support the app</h2>
        <p>Your purchase puts more time into testing, design, and making Goal Grower feel easier to use.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-purchase-card">
        <span>💡</span>
        <h2>Fuel better features</h2>
        <p>Support helps shape the next tools and smoother experiences inside the app.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-purchase-card">
        <span>🚀</span>
        <h2>Move launch forward</h2>
        <p>Every order helps the team prepare for a better public release.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-ad-section">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Why this matters</span>
      <h2>Support that helps Goal Grower actually improve.</h2>
      <p>
        This isn’t just a donation. It’s a way to help build the app with more polish, better testing,
        and a launch that feels ready for people who want progress to feel alive.
      </p>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Shop to Support</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Purchase",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Goal Grower Purchase" }]
}
{% endschema %}